        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa muntu uutola bamwi kubuzike, alakwe mwini uyootolwa kubuzike, ayooyo uujazya ipanga, alakwe uyoojayigwa apanga mbubonya. Mbuboobo mbuluboneka lukakatilo lwabasalali alusyomo lwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
