        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ndakabona cinyama cimbi cizwida munyika. Eci cinyama cakalijisi meja obile mbuli mwanambelele, pele kwaamba cakali kwaamba mbuli Simwaaba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bwami boonse bwacinyama citaanzi, eci cabili cakabubelesya kumeso aceeco citaanzi. Cakasungilizya inyika yoonse abantu boonse bali mulinjiyo kuti bakombe cinyama citaanzi icakaponesegwa ciyaso caco calufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
